# Private to the alignment module (_RY_ALIGNMENT_): rasayan 1.2.0's matrices are private,
# so every cell is read from rust-old/src/alignment.rs, never re-typed, and checked against
# substitution_score for all 400 pairs of both. A matrix is row-major: row i, column j at
# i * 20 + j, i and j the residues' _RY_ALIGNMENT_AA_INDEX. tests/golden/alignment.tsv pins
# every cell through substitution_score.

